The Diamond District is one of the wealthier parts of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. Jewelers and fine metalworkers keep their shops here, close to high-end housing. Its residents can afford cars, so public transport does not run in, and a visitor reaches it on foot or by taxi.
